# Secrets hygiene

| Commit | Local only |
|--------|------------|
| `secrets.ini.example` | `secrets.ini` |
| `secrets/README.md`, `certs/README.md` | PEMs, keys, claim/device material |
| AWS JSON with `REGION` / `ACCOUNT_ID` placeholders | Live ARNs if you keep them private |

- Override only `custom_aws_iot_endpoint` and `custom_aws_provisioning_template` in `secrets.ini`
- Before commit/push: `./scripts/check_no_secrets.sh`
- Never embed Wi-Fi passwords or private keys in source or `platformio.ini`
